# Task 148-021: Routing V3 Intent Classifier — core-dev Sub-Intents

## Approach
1. Add `subIntent` field to `TaskDNA` in `routing-types.ts`
2. Add `SubIntentType` union type
3. Implement `detectSubIntent()` in `intent-classifier.ts`
4. Wire sub-intent into `classifyIntent()`
5. Add `routingVersion` field to `RoutingDecision` in `routing-types.ts`
6. Set `routingVersion: 'v3'` in `routeTaskV2()` output
7. Add 'devops' and 'architecture' to IntentType union (per DIRECTIVES)
8. Write 6 tests in `tests/core/intent-v3.test.ts`

